# This repo is authored on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) but deployed to Linux,
# so line endings are not cosmetic here. A shell script committed with CRLF
# fails on the server with `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M`, and a
# systemd unit gets a trailing \r inside ExecStart. Force LF in the repository
# for everything that a Linux box executes or parses.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh      text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.conf    text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
